    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>6级 游击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 类人生物（蜘蛛）</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 72；''重伤'' 36</span><span>''先攻'' +9</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 20，''强韧'' 18，''反射'' 19，''意志'' 17</span><span>''侦查'' +10</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6，攀爬 6（蛛行）</span><span>''感官'' 黑暗视觉</span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">战斗优势</div>\n<div class=description>该蛛妖掠夺者对任何提供战斗优势给它的生物造成 1d6 额外伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}短剑（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+11vs.AC<br>命中：1d6+4 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}快速猛戳✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>效果：该蛛妖掠夺者进行两次短剑攻击。它可以在每次攻击之后快步 2 格。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">移动动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">蛛丝✦遭遇</div>\n<div class=description>前提：该蛛妖掠夺者处于攀爬。<br>效果：该蛛妖掠夺者飞行 5 格。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 杂技+12，隐秘+12</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 12（+4）</span><span>''敏捷'' 18（+7）</span><span>''感知'' 15（+5）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 16（+6）</span><span>''智力'' 11（+3）</span><span>''魅力'' 10（+3）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 混乱邪恶</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 通用语，精灵语</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''装备'' 2 把短剑</span></div></div>\n</div>",
